# layer-3 phase 3 ACCEPTANCE lane -- cpp -- generated by
# Research/kind_fuzz_clustering/l3_lanes.py .  Do not hand-edit.
# Route: value matrix, route A, shard 0/1.  Probes: 110 (full ordered pairs x operation menu).
